  "description": "***Available Immediately*** Fully Furnished **First Let Following Renovation***Beautifully presented one double bedroom, one bathroom, second floor apartment, extending to approx. 56sqm of accommodation with one secure designated parking space. Accommodation consists of entrance hallway which leads into the open plan kitchen/living/dining room. This room is bright, sunny and spacious, with a dining area, living area, and a door to the patio. Fully fitted kitchen with fridge/freezer, oven, hob, dishwasher, microwave, washing machine and a dryer. Master bedroom with fitted wardrobes, and balcony off. Main bathroom with bath/shower and large storage press. Ideally located in Milltown, Mount St. Anne's is one the most popular developments in the Dublin 6 area. Residents can avail of easy access at the back of the complex to the LUAS station. Local shops, N11 and M50 routes are all within easy reach. Dundrum Shopping Centre only a short few miles away.**Professionally Managed by Sherry Fitzgerald Lettings**",
